216
00:15:31,550 --> 00:15:32,550
Li.

217
00:15:33,480 --> 00:15:34,250
Li.

218
00:15:34,251 --> 00:15:35,820
No te enojes con tu papá.

219
00:15:36,250 --> 00:15:38,410
Ya sabes cómo es.

220
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:42,050
